h("MSPAM",H2,"checkout","easy","What is check-out time at our Hampton?","¿A qué hora es la salida (check-out) en nuestro Hampton?",["11 a.m.","Noon","10 a.m.","1 p.m."],["A las 11 a. m.","Al mediodía","A las 10 a. m.","A la 1 p. m."],"Hilton lists check-out at 11 a.m. Late check-out depends on availability — ask the desk.","Hilton indica salida a las 11 a. m. La salida tarde depende de disponibilidad; pregunta en recepción.",HP)
