h("MSPAM",D,"parking","hard","A guest wants covered underground parking at our Hampton. What do you say?","Un huésped quiere estacionamiento techado subterráneo en nuestro Hampton. ¿Qué le dices?",["It's $30 a night and limited — check availability","It's free for everyone","We don't have any parking","Only valet, $50 a night"],["Cuesta $30 por noche y es limitado; hay que revisar disponibilidad","Es gratis para todos","No tenemos estacionamiento","Solo valet, $50 por noche"],"Hilton's page notes $30/night underground parking with limited availability.","La página de Hilton indica estacionamiento subterráneo a $30 por noche con disponibilidad limitada.",HP)
h("MSPAM",D,"ev","med","A guest with an electric car asks about charging at our Hampton.","Un huésped con carro eléctrico pregunta dónde cargar en nuestro Hampton.",["There's no on-site charger — the nearest is about 0.8 miles away","Chargers are in every parking spot","Plug into the lobby outlet","Charging is in the underground ramp"],["No hay cargador en el hotel; el más cercano está a unas 0.8 millas","Hay cargador en cada lugar","Que conecte en un contacto del lobby","Se carga en el estacionamiento subterráneo"],"Hilton lists EV charging 'nearby, 0.80 miles', not on-site.","Hilton indica carga para eléctricos 'cerca, a 0.80 millas', no en el hotel.",HP)
