h("MSPAM",X,"pets","hard","What's the pet fee at our Hampton for a 6-night stay?","¿Cuál es el cargo por mascota en nuestro Hampton para 6 noches?",["$125 (non-refundable, 5+ nights)","$75 per night","$25 total","No fee"],["$125 (no reembolsable, 5 noches o más)","$75 por noche","$25 en total","Sin cargo"],"Hilton lists $75 for 1–4 nights and $125 for 5+ nights.","Hilton indica $75 por 1 a 4 noches y $125 por 5 noches o más.",HP)
