h("MSPAM",X,"meetings","med","A planner asks how big a group our Hampton's meeting space holds.","Un organizador pregunta para cuántas personas es la sala de juntas de nuestro Hampton.",["Up to about 35 people","Up to 500 people","We have no meeting space","Up to 10 people"],["Hasta unas 35 personas","Hasta 500 personas","No tenemos salas","Hasta 10 personas"],"Hilton lists bookable meeting space for up to 35 people.","Hilton indica sala de juntas para hasta 35 personas.",HP)
