h("MSPWE",H2,"smoking","easy","Can guests smoke anywhere inside our Holiday Inn Express?","¿Se puede fumar dentro de nuestro Holiday Inn Express?",["No — it's a smoke-free hotel","Only in suites","Only in the pool area","Yes, on the 3rd floor"],["No, es un hotel libre de humo","Solo en suites","Solo en la alberca","Sí, en el 3er piso"],"IHG lists the property as smoke-free.","IHG indica que el hotel es libre de humo.",IP)
h("MSPWE",X,"groups","med","A coach asks if we do team room blocks at our Holiday Inn Express.","Un entrenador pregunta si hacemos bloques de cuartos para equipos en nuestro Holiday Inn Express.",["Yes — group blocks are available; take their details for the sales/GM team","No groups allowed","Only on weekdays","Only for adults"],["Sí, hay bloques de grupo; toma sus datos para ventas o el gerente","No se aceptan grupos","Solo entre semana","Solo adultos"],"IHG says group room blocks are available for sports teams and events.","IHG dice que hay bloques de cuartos para equipos y eventos.",IP)
